1
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:11,883
高雄仁武，田野與街巷之間，有一群人默默行善。
In Renwu, Kaohsiung, among fields and lanes, people quietly do good.

2
00:00:13,533 --> 00:00:17,783
他們相信：人溺己溺，人飢己飢。
They believe another's hardship is their own.

3
00:00:27,433 --> 00:00:30,950
這是高雄市堅山慈善會的故事。
This is the story of the Kaohsiung Jianshan Charity Association.

4
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:44,483
民國八十五年九月，七位鄉親發起慈善籌備會。
In September 1996, seven neighbours formed a charity preparatory group.

5
00:00:46,133 --> 00:00:51,717
八十六年元旦，堅山南邑慈善會正式運作。
On New Year's Day 1997, the Jianshan Nanyi Charity Association began work.

6
00:00:53,367 --> 00:00:57,883
首任會長李慶瑞，把自家住所借作會址。
Its first president, Li Ching-jui, lent his own home as its office.

7
00:01:06,033 --> 00:01:11,383
會員很快破百，八十七年遷到林山巷新會址。
Members soon passed 100, and in 1998 it moved to Linshan Lane.

8
00:01:13,033 --> 00:01:18,350
會館另外募款興建，從不動用慈善基金。
The hall was built with separate donations, never touching charity funds.

9
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:25,550
九十年正式立案，黃金城當選首屆理事長。
Registered in 2001, it elected Huang Chin-cheng as first chairman.

10
00:01:33,700 --> 00:01:38,917
九十二年成立顧問團，陪伴會務一路向前。
In 2003 an advisory group was formed to support its work.

11
00:01:40,567 --> 00:01:46,983
陳國泰四度出任理事長，會員成長到九百多人。
Chen Kuo-tai served four terms as chairman; members grew past 900.

12
00:01:48,633 --> 00:01:53,350
一百零一年，大家終於搬進自己的會館。
In 2012, members finally moved into a hall of their own.

13
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:01,650
洪丰裕、沈玉文到李國忠，一棒接一棒傳承。
From Hung Feng-yu and Shen Yu-wen to Li Kuo-chung, the torch passed on.

14
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:16,350
急難救助是堅山的核心，理監事每月輪流訪視。
Emergency relief is its core; board members take turns visiting each month.

15
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:24,150
前理事長陳國泰與夫人吳惠豐，至今仍親自訪視。
Former chairman Chen and his wife Wu Hui-feng still visit in person.

16
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:33,283
一一二年，協助高雄、台南、屏東急難個案八十八件。
In 2023, it helped 88 emergency cases in Kaohsiung, Tainan and Pingtung.

17
00:02:34,933 --> 00:02:39,917
也為兩戶清寒家庭，辦妥完整的喪葬事宜。
It also arranged complete funerals for two families in need.

18
00:02:48,067 --> 00:02:55,283
同年兩場觀音山捐血，共募得七百六十三袋熱血。
Two blood drives at Guanyin Mountain that year gathered 763 bags.

19
00:03:04,433 --> 00:03:11,250
九月，在仁武慰問五區六百七十戶清寒家庭。
In September, 670 low-income households in five districts received aid.

20
00:03:12,900 --> 00:03:19,250
十一月，九十四位清寒優秀學子領到獎助學金。
In November, 94 bright students in need received scholarships.

21
00:03:27,900 --> 00:03:34,283
每月救急、每季關懷身障朋友，行善從不停歇。
Monthly relief and quarterly visits to people with disabilities never stop.

22
00:03:35,933 --> 00:03:41,383
從七個人到上千位會員，善念一路擴散。
From seven people to over a thousand members, kindness has spread.

23
00:03:43,033 --> 00:03:46,817
下一位伸出援手的，也許就是你。
The next person to lend a hand could be you.

24
00:03:48,467 --> 00:03:53,950
高雄市堅山慈善會，邀您一起，讓愛延續。
The Kaohsiung Jianshan Charity Association invites you to keep love going.

